WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.855
Start and controls
Take a seat and press Ready. The host starts when everyone is ready. Your cards or dice are at the bottom.

00:00:12.855 --> 00:00:19.156
Follow the turn prompt. Wait for animations to finish; an expired turn is played automatically. Use Return to room after settlement.

00:00:19.156 --> 00:00:35.156
Red Points: capture scoring red cards
Each player has 6 cards, with 4 on the table and 24 in stock. Follow Demo E and aim for the highest captured red-card score.

00:00:35.156 --> 00:00:48.356
Play and choose a capture
Click a hand card on your turn. If several targets match, click one highlighted table card. A sole target is captured automatically; no match leaves the played card on the table.

00:00:48.356 --> 00:00:59.156
A counts as 1. A–9 pair to total 10; 10, J, Q, and K pair only with the same rank. Capturing is compulsory when possible.

00:00:59.156 --> 00:01:19.156
Resolve your card and a stock flip
After each hand card, the game flips one stock card. Watch captures and cards left on the table; you capture a single matching target, not the entire table.

00:01:19.156 --> 00:01:39.156
A flipped card may need a choice
Continue counterclockwise. A flipped card with one target resolves automatically; several targets pause the turn for a choice.

00:01:39.156 --> 00:01:52.356
Choose a target for the visible flip
The heart two is now face up, with multiple eights available. Click one highlighted eight to finish this turn.

00:01:52.356 --> 00:02:03.156
This choice belongs to the flipped card. Do not select another hand card.

00:02:03.156 --> 00:02:13.056
Compare points, not just card counts
Use the visible captured cards and score display to understand scoring before continuing.

00:02:13.056 --> 00:02:21.156
Only hearts and diamonds score: A=20, 2–9 face value, 10–K=10. Black cards and cards left on the table score zero.

00:02:21.156 --> 00:02:51.156
Speed through every remaining play and flip
All remaining turns, including further flip choices, play in order at higher speed. Settlement waits until both stock and hands are empty.

00:02:51.156 --> 00:03:10.167
Red Points: final scores
Demo W wins with 89 points. Demo N, E, and S score 31, 38, and 50.
